            <title>0.4.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:46:03 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.4.1</link>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.4.1

This update is a focused interface-polish release.

## Improvements

- Reorganized the menu into clear **Features** and **Library** sections with icons and cleaner labels.
- Added comfortable padding to action buttons throughout Kiki.
- Simplified the Models page so its introduction no longer resembles a selectable model.
- Renamed speech profiles in plain language and added a live explanation for every option.
- Added clickable information controls explaining each Flow setting.
- Replaced the boxed “New in Kiki” badge with a cleaner typographic highlight.
- Brightened primary controls in Dark Mode while preserving accessible contrast.

Transcription speed, model quality, and Kiki’s local-first privacy remain unchanged.
]]></description>
