        <item>
            <title>0.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:21:45 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.4.0</link>
            <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.4.0

Kiki now has a complete visual workspace built around speed, clarity, and local voice intelligence.

## What’s new

- A redesigned Settings experience with persistent sidebar navigation and clear model cards.
- Adaptive Dark, Light, and Follow System appearances with accessible contrast.
- Explicit **Use Model** and **Download & Use** actions for every transcription model.
- A redesigned Personalization Studio, Meeting Mode, transcription history, dictionary, file transcription, and listening HUD.
- A new What’s New experience for discovering major features.
- Live transcription, local intelligence, correction learning, snippets, private apps, meeting capture, chapters, action-item hints, and caption export.

All transcription and personalization data remain local to your Mac.
]]></description>
